#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:361
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Ka whakamahia te Waehere Whenua Taunoa ki te whakahōputu tau karekau he "
"prefix o te ao (hei tauira, +358).\n"
"\n"
"Ki te waiho putua, ka ngana te punaha ki te kimi aunoa mai i to kaari SIM, "
"whatunga ranei.\n"
"\n"
"Ka taea e koe te whakakore a-ringa ki konei ma te whakauru i te waehere rohe "
"ISO 2-reta (hei tauira, US, FI, DE) he waehere waea ranei (hei tauira +358, "
"358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:382
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Ko te tangi whakamuri ko te tangi i whakatangihia (toot-toot-toot) i te wa e "
"tatari ana kia whakautua mai he waea puta. Ko etahi o nga kaikawe kaore e "
"whakaputa na reira ka whai waahi taatau ki te whakaputa a-ringa ki konei. \n"
"\n"
"Ka taea e koe te kowhiri i to ake ake konae puoro, ka whiti ranei hei "
"whakamahi i te oro punaha paerewa."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:402
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Tīpakohia te Ringback Tone"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:410
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Kōnae Ororongo"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:436
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Tīpakohia ngā pukapuka wāhitau hei whakamahi mā te Waea Waea ka "
"whakaraupapahia kia rite ki te kaupapa matua. Ko te pukapuka wahitau runga "
"rawa te kaupapa matua, ka pai ake mena ka kitea he nama i roto i nga "
"pukapuka wahitau maha. Ka taea e koe te whakamahi i te takahuri Resolver "
"Resolver i raro nei hei awhina i te whakahaere i nga taarua, engari ahakoa "
"kua haua, ka akiakihia kia pai ake te wheako."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:455
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Ina whakahohea, ki te 3 nga wa ka waea atu te nama waea ki a koe i roto i te "
"5 meneti, ko te waea tuatoru (me nga waea e whai ake nei i roto i te "
"matapihi) ka kaha te waea ki te tangi i te rahi o te reo, ma te whakawhiti i "
"nga ahuatanga Wahangu, Kaua ranei e Whakakorikori."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:467
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Whiriwhiria nga hoapaki ka purei whakamohiotanga i nga wa katoa, ahakoa ko "
"te waea kei roto i te aratau Wahangu, Kaua ranei e Rararo."

