#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:540
msgid "TOTP Setup"
msgstr "Tautuhinga TOTP"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:586
msgid ""
"Share this code with your trusted contact. They should add it to an "
"authenticator app such as Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"If entering manually, ensure the following settings:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 seconds\n"
"\n"
"Each action has its own code. When triggering an action by SMS, they must "
"append the current 6-digit code from their authenticator after the keyword."
msgstr ""
"Tirihia tenei waehere ki to hoapaki pono. Me tapiri e ratou ki tetahi "
"taupānga motuhēhē pēnei i a Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"Mēnā ka uru ā-ringa, me whakarite ngā tautuhinga e whai ake nei:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 hēkona\n"
"\n"
"Kei ia mahi tana ake waehere. I te wa e whakaohooho ana i tetahi mahi ma te "
"SMS, me taapiri te waehere 6-mati o naianei mai i o raatau motuhēhē i muri i "
"te kupuhipa."

